  "analysis": "The AgentMemory module is not installed. Based on the SKILL.md documentation, I need to implement the AgentMemory class myself since the clawdhub installation isn't available. The skill provides a clear API: remember(), learn(), recall(), get_lessons(), and track_entity() methods.",
  "plan": "I'll create the src/memory.py module implementing the AgentMemory class using SQLite for persistence at ~/.agent-memory/memory.db. Then I'll create a main script that loads data from memory_input.json and generates a summary.",
  "commands": [
